00:57:42.860 --> 00:57:44.390
<v Mark Levin>This Cantor is the worst!
<v Mark Levin>这个坎托是最烂的！

00:57:44.390 --> 00:57:49.390
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《这就是美国生活》的故事。
